# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Release artifact exceptions
# Keep the Release folder's useful installer/resources/source files versioned, while leaving large compiled executables ignored.
# Tracked exceptions
# The NSIS installer script is source code, not build output.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# !x64/
# x64/*
# !x64/Release/
# x64/Release/*
# !x64/Release/install_script.nsi
# !x64/Release/LICENCE.rtf
# !x64/Release/README.html
# !x64/Release/Windows_Hello_Fix_v2_0.exe.metagen
# !x64/Release/WindowsHelloFix.ico

# Keep compiled executables out of Git history.
x64/Release/Windows_Hello_Fix_Setup.exe
x64/Release/Windows_Hello_Fix_v2_0.exe
